    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Manual validation only. Present highest risk is critical inherent from untrusted supplier invoices reaching irreversible payment scheduling. The declared approval control is a summary-only human gate with high approval volume, so under rubric step 2 it reduces the payment path by one tier to high and the bank-update path by one tier to moderate, but it cannot reduce below moderate and is vulnerable to approval fatigue and model persuasion. Broad ERP credentials leave a present confused-deputy exposure. Forecast rises to critical because model_upgrade or autonomy_increase defeats the summary gate first, and the design states the model is upgraded with the platform without separate review."
  },
